{"series_id": "7706182626935065624", "episode_id": "7706182632135986238", "title": "我手握三座矿山，坐等拆迁", "scope": "first_episode_comment", "sampled_at_sh": "2026-11-22T19:18:09+08:00", "source": "https://hongguoduanju.com/player/7706182626935065624", "sha256": "17e8d1b5bf24c23e1728bef210984e9b9c0c266efb511e0acaaaecedec98fb31", "reported_total": "185", "metrics": {"episode_like_count": "21828"}, "rows": [{"position": 1, "text": "这三座金山的矿，你现在也发财了，没了事业，和你兄弟两个，一个一床房子还剩钱，两地相分，好好的过日子，搞团结。", "comment_time": "1795260577", "comment_like_count": "1", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 2, "text": "矿藏属于国家，你承包土地和矿藏一点关系都没[偷笑]除非你承包了开采权（赔偿也是按照开采权上的矿进行评估）.", "comment_time": "1795255119", "comment_like_count": "1", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 3, "text": "人家的房子要拆迁了，你当个大伯来抢人家的房子，你们村子里的这些人，还帮他这个恶毒的大伯说话。", "comment_time": "1795163405", "comment_like_count": "0", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 4, "text": "[赞][赞][赞][爱心][爱心][爱心][爱心][送花][送花][送花][送花]", "comment_time": "1795227434", "comment_like_count": "0", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 5, "text": "你这个大伯都是向人家的拆迁款，向人家的钱，你真是不要脸，你兄弟死了，你的强子欺负侄子", "comment_time": "1795255931", "comment_like_count": "0", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 6, "text": "梦里啥都有真不要脸！人为什么老是掂记别人家的东西那！太自私自利了！为了自己的利益坑害家人！村管也又势欺人！这样的人早睌害人害己更会遭报应和雷劈的！就作妖吧！人在做天在看苍天饶过谁呢！", "comment_time": "1795300356", "comment_like_count": "0", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 7, "text": "我大伯那会也是这么说的，我一巴掌过去什么都安静了[捂脸][捂脸]，我尼玛又不是未成年，结婚有孩子了用的着亲戚操心？", "comment_time": "1795235617", "comment_like_count": "0", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 8, "text": "现在，三防？一防亲属。二防闺蜜！三铁哥们？也啥防这？因为，外人，坑自己，不可能！这三？防不胜防？？？？？？", "comment_time": "1795254863", "comment_like_count": "0", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 9, "text": "村民都是这副德行，很真实！", "comment_time": "1795174644", "comment_like_count": "77", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 10, "text": "气氛组很到位", "comment_time": "1795212014", "comment_like_count": "35", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 11, "text": "就算是真的，金矿是国家的[捂脸][捂脸][捂脸]", "comment_time": "1794829251", "comment_like_count": "30", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 12, "text": "他叫大山，拿3座荒山就对了[赞][赞][赞][赞][赞]", "comment_time": "1795147507", "comment_like_count": "29", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 13, "text": "这村长厉害[赞]村民也很明理[捂脸][捂脸][捂脸][捂脸][捂脸][捂脸]", "comment_time": "1795171435", "comment_like_count": "25", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 14, "text": "[笑哭]这表演的不错", "comment_time": "1795151381", "comment_like_count": "24", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}, {"position": 15, "text": "[笑哭]这表演的不错", "comment_time": "1795137706", "comment_like_count": "22", "rating": null, "comment_id": null}]}